# fisher-82i, 2026-11-26. Staged for fisher-b0b.
# Token separators observed in Stockfish 19 (sf_19, edb0d9d), Homebrew arm64 bottle:
# UCIEngine::position reads the FEN tokens with operator>> under the C locale,
# so U+00A0 stays inside the en passant token.
# https://github.com/official-stockfish/Stockfish/blob/edb0d9db6731067ec50ce619ff372b463bc4dd5d/src/uci.cpp#L498-L522
# Stockfish then reads the clocks without requiring the extraction to succeed
# and shows 0 1 for both commands below; that is permissive clock parsing of a
# malformed FEN, not acceptance of the clocks.
# https://github.com/official-stockfish/Stockfish/blob/edb0d9db6731067ec50ce619ff372b463bc4dd5d/src/position.cpp#L420-L433
# fisher-b0b keeps the joined token and applies fisher's existing FEN field
# validation, which rejects an en passant field that is neither - nor a square
# with "invalid en passant square" (rules::Position::from_fen).
# See README.md for the probes, their output and a hex dump of each send.
# Owner-approved terminal example from terminal-positions.uci (fisher-2aj.2):
# Black is checkmated, so a search reports depth 0 and the null move.
> position fen 7k/6Q1/5K2/8/8/8/8/8 b - - 0 1
> go
< info depth 0 score mate 0
< bestmove 0000
# The en passant token is the bytes 2D C2 A0 30, followed by the token 1.
> position fen 4k3/8/8/8/8/8/8/4K2R w K -\xc2\xa00 1
# Owner decision for rejected position: one diagnostic for a malformed FEN.
< info string {message:invalid en passant square}
> isready
# UCI isready/readyok after the single diagnostic.
< readyok
# A rejected position leaves the checkmated position in place.
> go
< info depth 0 score mate 0
< bestmove 0000
# The en passant token is the bytes 2D C2 A0 37, followed by the token 42.
> position fen 4k3/8/8/8/8/8/8/4K2R w K -\xc2\xa07 42
# Owner decision for rejected position: one diagnostic for a malformed FEN.
< info string {message:invalid en passant square}
> isready
# UCI isready/readyok after the single diagnostic.
< readyok
# A rejected position leaves the checkmated position in place.
> go
< info depth 0 score mate 0
< bestmove 0000
# UCI quit.
> quit
! exit
